PaperDIY Reader
===============

This project is a hardware port and downstream fork of CrossPoint Reader.

Upstream:
  CrossPoint Reader 2.0.0 (develop branch)
  https://github.com/crosspoint-reader/crosspoint-reader
  Commit: 308cd522155ec11c3f62e346a1a961facd3dad80 (2026-11-03)
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2025 CrossPoint Reader organization

Hardware abstraction:
  FreeInk SDK
  https://github.com/Free-Ink/freeink-sdk
  Commit: 5e94fe7480f019c89fbf691aef87523eb1b46704
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 FreeInk

Display / board support:
  M5GFX / LovyanGFX
  https://github.com/m5stack/M5GFX
  License: MIT (LovyanGFX) / M5Stack

Other third-party libraries (SdFat, ArduinoJson, PNGdec, JPEGDEC,
AnimatedGIF, WebSockets, wolfSSL, NimBLE-Arduino, QRCode, expat, FreeType,
miniz, etc.) retain their own licenses; see `licenses/README.md`, the
respective library directories and PlatformIO package metadata.

The combined firmware executable uses GPLv3 because it includes wolfSSL.
The root `LICENSE` covers the original CrossPoint code; third-party material
keeps its own terms.

